-- UI frame refs + position helpers, packed into a single UI table so they
-- don't burn ~10 separate top-level register slots. MUST be declared before
-- saveConfig() because Lua/Luau binds free names at function-definition time:
-- if these live below saveConfig they resolve as nil globals and the save
-- crashes with "attempt to call a nil value" the first time positions write.
